# Day 32 — Getting Started with Spring AI 🚀

After learning LangChain4j, today I started exploring Spring AI and built my first AI-powered REST API using Spring Boot, Spring AI, and Groq.

## Day 31 — What I Learned

- What Spring AI is
- Why it is useful for Java/Spring Boot developers
- Spring AI vs LangChain4j
- Basic AI application architecture
- Chat models, prompts and AI integrations

## Day 32 — What I Built

### Tech Stack

- Java 17
- Spring Boot 4.1.1
- Spring AI 2.0.0
- Groq
- Maven
- REST API

### What I Learned

- `ChatClient`
- System prompts
- Dynamic user prompts
- Temperature
- REST API integration
- Connecting Spring AI with Groq

Basic flow:

```text
REST API
   ↓
ChatController
   ↓
ChatService
   ↓
ChatClient
   ↓
Groq
   ↓
AI Response

LangChain4j vs Spring AI
LangChain4j	Spring AI
ChatLanguageModel / AI Services	ChatClient
AiServices	ChatClient + Spring DI
EmbeddingStore	VectorStore
ChatMemory	ChatMemory
RAG / RetrievalAugmentor	Advisors / RAG
Java-focused LLM framework	Spring ecosystem focused
